# Building for the StormOS ISO

Place this project directory in your local package source tree, or create a source
archive named stormos-react-desktop-0.1.0.tar.gz containing the project directory.

Build locally:

    makepkg -s

Install the resulting package:

    sudo pacman -U stormos-react-desktop-0.1.0-1-$(uname -m).pkg.tar.zst

For archiso, add `stormos-react-desktop` to packages.x86_64 after placing the built
package in a custom repository or package cache. The package installs:

    /usr/share/stormos-shell/dist/
    /usr/share/stormos-shell/stormos-shell-host.py
    /usr/share/stormos-shell/stormos-session.sh
    /usr/share/wayland-sessions/stormos.desktop
    /usr/share/backgrounds/stormos/stormos-wallpaper.svg
    /usr/bin/stormos-session
    /usr/bin/stormos-shell-host


This release includes draggable React window title bars and GVFS runtime dependencies.
